      "text": "SELECT ROUND(100 * :depenses_formation\n         / :masse_salariale, 2) AS for_msal,\n       ROUND(100 * :depenses_formation\n         / :total_budget, 2)    AS for_bud\nFROM   DUAL\n-- FOR / MSAL : entre 1 % et 5 %",
